# Conventional Commits
#
# Examples:
#   feat: add catalog API endpoints
#   fix: adjust cart persistence on checkout
#   docs: update project architecture readme
#   refactor: split catalog service into domain layers
#   test: add API integration coverage
#   chore: update dependencies and CI config
#
# <type>: <short summary>
#
# body: optional details
#
# footer: optional issue reference
#
# Remember:
# - Use lowercase type
# - Keep the first line under 72 chars
# - Separate body and footer with a blank line
